  "caption": "Malay amapiano dance pop with South African log-drum groove. Deep pitched log drum bass sliding under each bar, busy shaker and open hi-hat pattern, jazzy Rhodes playing ninth chords, muted plucked guitar riff, sparse congas in the breaks. Warm wide club mix with dry upfront vocals and long log-drum tails. Male baritone lead singing relaxed and half-spoken, female backing pair answering the hook. 112 BPM, A minor. Cheeky, warm porch-party comedy. No trap hi-hats, no autotune, no EDM drop, no dangdut drums, no reggaeton dembow.",
  "lyrics": "[Intro - log drum, shaker and Rhodes]\n\n[Verse 1]\nDrama tengah klimaks\nTiba-tiba gelap gelita\nKipas berhenti pusing\nAircond pun diam saja\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nSayang cari lilin\nAku cari lampu suluh\n\n[Chorus]\nElektrik putus pukul sembilan\nKita duduk kat tangga depan\nMaggi dalam satu periuk\nKau dan aku, berpeluh-peluh\n\n[Verse 2]\nAku kipas muka kau\nDengan sampul bil elektrik\nKau gelak, kau kata\nBil ni pun ada guna\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nLilin makin pendek\nKau makin dekat\n\n[Chorus]\nElektrik putus pukul sembilan\nKita duduk kat tangga depan\nLampu menyala balik, sayang\nTapi kita tak nak masuk lagi\n\n[Outro - log drum and congas fade]",
